section('sources','10 / Scope, sources and handoff','''<div class="now-next"><div><h3>What is delivered</h3><p>A complete standalone HTML document with embedded fonts/assets, editable HTML/CSS/JavaScript mockup sources, an interactive prototype, the full flow gallery and an implementation/acceptance plan.</p></div><div><h3>What is not claimed</h3><p>The proposed mobile layout has not been merged into the app. Prototype payments are not real. OS keyboard behavior, mobile-wallet interoperability and production usability are not certified by these mockups.</p></div></div><p>Layout evidence is pinned to the existing source commit <code>'''+PIN+'''</code>. The separately requested 15% hover change is a small live-app update. The report’s gold APR/TVL/fee figures are illustrative unless explicitly identified as existing product copy.</p><ul class="sources">'''+links+'''</ul><div class="trace"><a href="https://clawbee.xyz/saffron/apps/feature-lab/live-apr-merge/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Existing merge page ↗</a><a href="#interactive">Return to interactive prototype ↑</a><a href="#delivery">Implementation plan ↑</a></div><p class="report-footer-note">Font: Funnel Display, SIL Open Font License. App imagery is reused from the current project. No external scripts, fonts, trackers, API calls or wallet requests are required to read or interact with this HTML file. Print expands the document’s sections, then restores their prior state.</p>''')

